    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##  🔍Teacher Notes\r\nThis activity is from <a href='https://studio.code.org/courses/artificial-intelligence-foundations-v2-2025/units/1/lessons/3' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;'>Lesson 3</a>. We've modified this activity for PL in two ways:\r\n1. Combined three separate curriculum levels into one.\r\n2. Turned partner discussion into individual reflections.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 1. Minimal Context Given\r\n\r\nPractice prompting through the career of a sports journalist by giving a simple, unstructured prompt to see how AI responds without any examples or extra details.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Try a basic prompt like the one below, or a similar one related to breaking news.\r\n\r\n>Summarize the latest sports news.\r\n\r\n2. Press **Send**.\r\n3. Read the response you get, paying attention to how much detail the AI includes and how clear or vague the summary is.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 2. Providing a Single Example\r\n\r\nPractice prompting through the career of a sports journalist by adding a single example to help guide the AI's response.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Write **an example 1-sentence news summary**\r\n2. Prompt AI for a news summary including your example. \r\n2. Press **Send**.\r\n3. Read the response you get, paying attention to how the example affects the tone, structure, or detail in the summary.\r\n\r\n::: details [**Not sure where to start?**]\r\nHere's an example prompt:\r\n> Summarize the latest sports news as a series of 1-sentence summaries. For example:\r\n>\r\n> Alabama wins over Texas Tech in nailbiter game.\r\n:::\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## 3. Providing Multiple Examples\r\n\r\nPractice prompting through the career of a sports journalist by giving the AI more structure and detailed expectations to guide a stronger response.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Prompt AI for a news summary by including **several examples** to help the AI understand what you're looking for. \r\n2. Before sending it, think about the difference between your prompt on this level and the previous one.\r\n2. Press **Send**.\r\n3. Read the response you get, paying attention to how adding structure and specific details improved the AI’s summary.\r\n\r\n::: details [**Not sure where to start?**]\r\nHere's an example prompt:\r\n> Summarize the latest sports news as a series of 1-sentence summaries. For example:\r\n>\r\n> Alabama wins over Texas Tech in nailbiter game.\r\n> Caitlin Clark autograph card sells for a record $84,000.\r\n> Stefon Diggs could transform the Patriots offense from the slot position.\r\n:::",
